└── README.md
```

## Requirements

To run this project, you need:

* Java JDK installed
* Any Java-supported IDE or code editor
* Command Prompt or Terminal

## How to Run

### 1. Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone YOUR_REPOSITORY_LINK
```

### 2. Open the Project

Navigate to the project folder:

```bash
cd TicketBooker
```

### 3. Compile the Program

```bash
javac TicketBooker.java
```

### 4. Run the Program

```bash
java TicketBooker
```

## Sample Flow

```text
-------- Ticket Booker --------
Welcome to the Ticket Booker

Available Movies:
1) Salaar
2) Pushpa 2
3) Toxic
4) Animal
5) Varsham (Re-release)

Select Movie (1-5):
```

After selecting the movie, the program asks for:

```text
Location
Theatre
Timing
Seat
```

Finally, it displays:

```text
-------- Booking Details --------
Movie    : Salaar
Location : Vizianagaram
Theatre  : LGT Cinemas
Time     : 9:30 AM
Seat     : B2
---------------------------------
Successfully Booked!
Enjoy Your Movie!
```

